### Get client memory (phone without '+', or '+' encoded as %2B)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/memory/998901234567
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Update operator part of client memory (null keeps, "" clears)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/memory/998901234567
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "preferredName": "Anvar aka",
  "preferredLanguage": "uz-UZ",
  "operatorNotes": "Kechqurun 18:00 dan keyin qo'ng'iroq qilish qulay"
}

### Set one fact by hand (marked as the operator's)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/memory/998901234567/facts/visitDay
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "value": "shanba kuni"
}

### Remove one fact
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/memory/998901234567/facts/visitDay
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Correct a remembered conversation (callId = recentCalls[].id)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/memory/998901234567/calls/c3a91f0d2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "summary": "Mijoz ertaga 18:00 dan keyin qayta qo'ng'iroq qilishni so'radi."
}

### Remove a remembered conversation (the call record itself stays)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/memory/998901234567/calls/c3a91f0d2
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Forget everything about the client
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/memory/998901234567
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
